!frontend/dist/

# TypeScript's incremental-build cache. NOT committed: `tsc -b` rewrites
# it on every build, so a tracked copy makes every build dirty the working
# tree -- which CI reads as "the recipe modified the tree" and fails,
# correctly. It carries no information anybody else needs; the artifact
# that matters is frontend/dist, above.
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

